title: Musa and the "remote job" that wanted his money
caption: "You're hired! Just pay $50 for your training kit" 🚩 If a remote job asks YOU to pay, it's a scam. Share this with someone job hunting 🙏 #remotejobs #scamalert #workfromhome #storytime
hook: HIRED... THEN ASKED TO PAY? | MUSA & QUDDUS
cta: STAY SAFE | 1f6a8 Real jobs don't charge you to work | 1f50e Check the company's official site
ctasay: Comment SAFE if a fake job ever messaged you, and share this with a friend who's job hunting.
bye: Follow before your next job interview!
cast: musa

== office | MORNING · SHARED OFFICE | modern shared office with glass walls, plants and laptops | desk @musa
musa (cheer): Quddus! I got a remote job! Data entry, five hundred dollars a week, and I didn't even do an interview!
quddus (think): No interview? How did they hire you?
musa (talk): They messaged me on Telegram. I just need to pay fifty dollars for my training kit and a work laptop activation.
quddus (shock): Musa. Close the chat. Now.
musa (worried): But they said spaces are limited!

== cafe | LATER · TEA SPOT | small cozy tea shop with hanging plants and soft lights | cafe
quddus (talk): Here's the rule. A real employer pays you. You never pay them to start working.
> 1f6a8 | FAKE JOB RED FLAGS | 1f4b8 Pay for training, kit or activation | 1f4f1 Hired on Telegram, no interview | 23f0 Pressure: spaces are limited | 1f4b0 Huge pay for very easy work
musa (think): So how do I know if a remote job is real?
quddus (point): Find the job on the company's official website or careers page. Check the email domain. And search the company name with the word scam.
> 2705 | HOW TO CHECK | 1f310 Job is on the official careers page | 1f4e9 Email from the company's domain | 1f50e Search the name plus "scam"
musa (facepalm): I was about to pay fifty dollars to become unemployed.
quddus (thumbs): Better you learn today than lose money tomorrow.
musa (cheer): Blocked, reported, and screenshot for the group chat!
